[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21900400_01_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21900400_01_0001","text":"主持人"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21900400_01_0010","text":"好了，今天的料理综艺节目开始了！\n《想吃你做的菜》今天的嘉宾是这个孩子！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21900400_01_0011","text":"偶像"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21900400_01_0020","text":"大家好～！\n新人偶像──"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21900400_01_0021","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21900400_01_0022","text":"主持人"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21900400_01_0030","text":"“平时经常做菜吗？”"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21900400_01_0031","text":"偶像"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21900400_01_0040","text":"“那个～，\n　家里连砧板和菜刀都没有！”"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21900400_01_0050","text":"（如果是我上这种节目的话──）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21900400_01_0051","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21900400_01_0060","text":"做好了\n味噌汤和烤鱼"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21900400_01_0061","text":"主持人"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21900400_01_0070","text":"哦哦，看起来很好吃呢～\n那么，我开动了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21900400_01_0080","text":"怎么样？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21900400_01_0090","text":"嗯……\n很普通呢～！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21900400_01_0100","text":"普通，是吗……"}]
